{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"櫻坂46の井上梨名です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日19時から放送"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テレビ朝日 「ナニコレ珍百景」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"に守屋麗奈と出演させて頂きます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その後が気になる珍百景をたくさんみさせて頂きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分の目で確かめてみたくなりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ、ご覧ください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01K2V7RFBVYHAMTEATW9TR57EX","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"23時からは、ニッポン放送にてこち星！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今夜のゲストは、佐藤愛桜ちゃん！\n4期生初登場です！\nお楽しみに〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サクラミーツ公開収録！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんのMeeterが来てくれて嬉しかったです！\n暑い中、本当にありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゲストに相席スタート山添さんが来てくださり、ミーツダービーをしました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は、予想する側ではなく出走側です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"公開収録の様子は先日のサクラミーツで放送されたので、まだ見てないよ！って方はぜひTVerで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"追いミーツもよろしくお願いします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01K2V7RMB4PJ3RZ5Z6J9AEV71P","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひょこ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01K2V7RQM8VQ1ZN222QVBEC5BW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01K2V7RTVBFQVWPQRDY271HBKJ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出番前、わくわくタイム。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01K2V7RYXY24GMXZ7CDP10C7JT","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"インパクト大のトーマス描いてた方。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01K2V7S1HVXG6Q3M06AQS1K9F8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんとゆいちゃんと撮っていなかったから、この写真で笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"増本はお家でおやすみ🐈‍⬛"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サクラミーツ3回目のイベントがんばるぞー！\nぜひ、遊びにきてねー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは今日はこの辺で、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後まで読んでくださりありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいば〜い🦒"}],"source":"archive"}